WEBVTT

00:00:00.103 --> 00:00:05.662
Intervals can also shift time Adding fourteen days
to a discharge

00:00:05.689 --> 00:00:11.544
timestamp creates a follow-up point two weeks later
Adding thirty days creates

00:00:11.557 --> 00:00:18.172
a longer window The interval makes the rule explicit
and readable in PostgreSQL
